# Product Context

- Build a real banking app for Android and iOS.
- Mobile stack is Kotlin Multiplatform Mobile with Compose Multiplatform.
- Backend stack is Kotlin Multiplatform with production-grade APIs.
- Prioritize security, auditability, and reliability over speed of delivery.
- Keep all proposals aligned with end-to-end transactional flows.

# Core Features Baseline

- Authentication and secure session management.
- Balance and account overview.
- Movements and payment history.
- Card payment and transfer flows.
- AI chat assistant for banking operations through backend tools.
